AStack's practice skills condense and adapt procedures, checklists and
decision rules from gstack's MIT-licensed skills (review, review/specialists,
review/checklist.md, review/gate-integrity.md, investigate, qa, plan-ceo-review,
plan-eng-review, plan-design-review, autoplan, ship, land-and-deploy, canary,
document-release). No gstack file is copied whole; the text was rewritten,
shortened and fitted to AStack's trust rules, tools and language policy. No
Apache-2.0 licensed file of gstack was used.

Adapted AStack files:

  skills/code-review/            (SKILL.md, checklist.md, skill.json, sections/*)
      from review/SKILL.md.tmpl, review/checklist.md, review/gate-integrity.md,
      review/specialists/*.md, review/sections/review-army.md
  skills/investigate/            (SKILL.md, checklist.md, skill.json, sections/*)
      from investigate/SKILL.md.tmpl, investigate/sections/flake.md,
      polluter.md, race.md
  skills/qa/                     (SKILL.md, checklist.md, skill.json, sections/*)
      from qa/SKILL.md.tmpl, qa/sections/scope.md, exploratory.md,
      system-functional.md, qa-patterns.md, qa/references/issue-taxonomy.md,
      qa/templates/qa-report-template.md
  skills/plan-review/            (SKILL.md, checklist.md, skill.json, sections/*)
      from plan-ceo-review, plan-eng-review, plan-design-review and
      autoplan (SKILL.md.tmpl and sections/review-sections.md)
  skills/ship/                   (SKILL.md, checklist.md, skill.json, sections/*)
      from ship/SKILL.md.tmpl, ship/sections/tests.md, documentation.md,
      changelog.md, land-and-deploy/SKILL.md.tmpl, canary/SKILL.md.tmpl,
      document-release/sections/audit-scope.md

The lazy section convention (a short SKILL.md plus sections/manifest.json and
section files opened only when their step is reached) follows gstack's
sections/manifest.json design.

